    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You come from Shadowmoor or have studied it for years: a gloomy, chaotic land forever lit by pale moonlight. You might survive its merciless conditions through wit and cunning, or keep its dangers at bay with strength and courage. Wherever you go, you know that friendship is rare, and that knowing whom to trust and whom to keep at a distance isn't just sensible—it is often a matter of life and death.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.pxO2ULjAT92e8nso]{Shadowmoor Hexer}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Acrobatics and Deception</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulGlassblowe]{Glassblower's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulGlassblowe]{Glassblower's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHuntingTrap]{Hunting Trap}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 8 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
